  "admission_inline_investigation": {
    "decision": "Rejected and source restored exactly to 0.23.9. Native opt-z ordinary encoding improved about 9-11% in selected runs, but packed-u16 decode regressed reproducibly about 69%. Broad opt-3 bulk encode anomaly did not reproduce in longer selected runs.",
